# The image needs only src/ and package.json (see Dockerfile). Keep everything else out so
# a local checkout's state, git history, and the type-checker never bloat the build context.
#
# SHARED with deploy/hetzner-up.sh's rsync, which copies a working tree onto a public box and then
# makes it world-readable. That copy previously kept its own hand-maintained list, drifted to three
# of these entries, and uploaded key material. One list, so it cannot drift again — which means the
# secret-bearing patterns below are load-bearing for more than image size.
node_modules
.git
.DS_Store
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.pem
*.key
backup
docs
reference-servers
deploy
.github
